WEBVTT

00:02:29.003 --> 00:02:32.956
Jedne noći sam šetao 
oko štale sa lampom,

00:02:32.956 --> 00:02:36.799
i taj dan lavovi nisu došli.

00:02:36.799 --> 00:02:41.357
I tada sam otkrio
da se lavovi boje pokretnog svetla.

00:02:41.357 --> 00:02:43.930
Pa sam imao ideju.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.240
Još od kad sam bio mali,

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:49.498
radio sam u mojoj sobi
po ceo dan,

00:02:49.498 --> 00:02:52.604
čak sam i rastavio
majčin novi radio,

00:02:52.604 --> 00:02:54.422
i tog dana me skoro ubila,

00:02:54.422 --> 00:03:00.676
ali sam naučio 
dosta o elektronici. (Smeh)